#. Description of the plugin
#: init.php
msgid "Fix Image Rotation plugin fixes image orientation based on EXIF data.  This is primarily a patch for mis-oriented images delivered from iPhones.  Functionally it filters all uploads and if EXIF->Orientation is set to a number greater than 1, then the image is resaved with a new orientation before the image is processed by WordPress."
msgstr ""

